Cell["\<\
Branching ratios and squared matrix elements for 3-body decays\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9520620794241467`*^9, 
  3.952062090178158*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6f6c91bb-a059-4944-b51e-\
